    <item>
      <title>02 जन्माद्यधिकरणम्</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/02_janmAdyadhikaraNam/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/02_janmAdyadhikaraNam/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;१. जन्माद्य्-अधिकरणम्&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;जन्माद्य् अस्य यतः&amp;rdquo; (ब्र.सू. १-१-२)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;भृगु-वल्ल्यां श्रूयते -&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;यतो वा इमानि भूतानि जायन्ते ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;येन जातानि जीवन्ति ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;यत् प्रयन्त्य् अभिसंविशन्ति ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;तद् विजिज्ञासस्व तद् ब्रह्मेति&amp;rdquo; ।&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sArasvata-vibhAgaH/AraNyakam/sarva-prastutiH/05_taittirIyopaniShat/23-42_vAruNy-upaniShat/33-42_bhRgu-vallI/33_brahma-jijnAsA&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;जीवन्ति&lt;/strong&gt; - &amp;ldquo;येनात्म-भूतेन जीवन्ती&amp;quot;त्य् अर्थः ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;&amp;ldquo;&lt;strong&gt;प्रयन्ति&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;rdquo; सन्ति -&lt;br&gt;&#xA;भूतानि यद् &lt;strong&gt;अभिसंविशन्ति&lt;/strong&gt; लीयमानानि सन्ति&lt;br&gt;&#xA;यद् &lt;strong&gt;अभिसंविशन्ति&lt;/strong&gt; यत्र लीयन्ते ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;समित्य् एकीकरणे ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;एकीकृततया प्रवेशः संवेशः ।+++(4)+++&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;यद् वा यत् &lt;strong&gt;प्रयन्तीति&lt;/strong&gt; मोक्षः ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अभिसंविशन्तीति प्रलयः ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अस्मिन् पक्षे  यच्-छब्दस्यावृत्तिः ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;लक्षणं समुदितम्॥&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>03 समन्वयाधिकरणम्</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/03_samanvayAdhikaraNam/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/03_samanvayAdhikaraNam/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;२. समन्वयाधिकरणम्&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;तत् तु समन्वयात् ॥&lt;/strong&gt; (ब्र. सू. १.१.४)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;भगवल-लकषणम&#34;&gt;भगवल्-लक्षणम्&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_yajuH/vAjasaneyam/mAdhyandinam/IshAvAsyopaniShat/shrI-vaiShNavAH/sarva-prastutiH/08_sa_paryagAchChukramakAyamavraNa&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इदम् वाक्यम् ईशावास्य-गतम् ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;वलकषणयम&#34;&gt;वैलक्षण्यम्&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/jaiminIyam/AraNyakam/upaniShad-brAhmaNam/04/10_kenopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/4_anyadeva_tad_viditAd&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;वग-अततम&#34;&gt;वाग्-अतीतम्&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/jaiminIyam/AraNyakam/upaniShad-brAhmaNam/04/10_kenopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/5_yad_vAchAnabhy_uditam&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इदम् च वाक्यम् तलवकारोपनिषद्-गतम् ॥&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>04 ईक्षत्यधिकरणम्</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/04_IxatyadhikaraNam/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/04_IxatyadhikaraNam/</guid>
      <description>&lt;ol start=&#34;3&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;ईक्षत्य्-अधिकरणम्&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ol&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ईक्षतेर् नाशब्दम् । (ब्र.सू. 1.1.5)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;प्रकृतिश् च प्रतिज्ञा-दृष्टान्तानुपरोधात् । (ब्र.सू. 1.4.22)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;तद्-अनन्यत्वम् आरम्भण-शब्दादिभ्यः । (ब्र.सू. 2.1.15)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;सञ्ज्ञा-मूर्ति-कॢप्तिस् तु&lt;br&gt;&#xA;त्रिवृत्-कुर्वत उपदेशात् । (ब्र.सू. 2.4.17)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;अनारब्ध-कार्ये एव तु पूर्वे तद्-अवधेः ॥ (ब्र.सू. 4.1.15)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;वाङ्-मनसि दर्शनाच्-छब्दाच् च ॥ (ब्र.सू. 4.2.1)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इत्य्-आदि-विषय-वाक्यार्थावगत्य्-अर्थं&lt;br&gt;&#xA;सद्-विद्या व्याख्यायते ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;छान्दोग्ये षष्ठाध्यायोपक्रमे स्पष्टा ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/01&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/02_sadeva_somyedam&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/03_nAma-rUpa-vyAkaraNAdi&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/04_agnyAdiShu_tejo-b-annAni&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/05_annAp-tejo-MshAH_sharIre&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/08&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/10&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/11&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/14&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/6/16&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>05 आनन्दमयाधिकरणम्</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/05_AnandamayAdhikaraNam/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/05_AnandamayAdhikaraNam/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;परचय&#34;&gt;परिचयः&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;४. आनन्दमयाधिकरणम् ॥ ६ ॥ आनन्दमयो ऽभ्यासात् (ब्र.सू. १.१.१३)&lt;br&gt;&#xA;परम-तत्त्व-हित-पुरुषार्थ-प्रतिपादिकानन्दवल्ली प्रस्तूयते ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;बरहम-वत&#34;&gt;ब्रह्म-वित्&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ब्रह्म-विद् आप्नोति परम् ॥&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;निरतिशय-बृहत्त्वाश्रय-वस्तूपासकः&lt;br&gt;&#xA;सर्वेभ्य उत्कृष्टं ब्रह्म प्राप्नोतीत्य् अर्थः -&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;आवृत्तिर् असकृद् उपदेशात् (ब्र.सू. ४.१.१)&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इत्य् अधिकरणोक्त-न्यायेन&lt;br&gt;&#xA;वेदनोपासनादि-शब्दानाम् एकार्थत्वात् ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ब्रह्म-विद् इत्य् अत्र&lt;br&gt;&#xA;विच्-छब्दो ऽप्य् उपासन-परः&lt;br&gt;&#xA;तत्-क्रतु-न्यायेन प्राप्यस्यैवोपास्यत्वात् ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;ब्रह्म-विद् आप्नोति परम्&amp;rdquo;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;इति परस्य ब्रह्मणः प्राप्यत्व-कथनात्&lt;br&gt;&#xA;तस्यैवोपास्यत्वम् इति द्रष्टव्यम् ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;चतुष्टयोक्तिः॥&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;अत्र ब्रह्म तद्-वेदनं प्राप्तिः प्राप्यं चेति चतुष्टयम् उक्तम् ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;किं तद्-ब्रह्म, कीदृशं तद्-वेदनं, कीदृशी प्राप्तिः, कीदृशं च प्राप्यम्&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;इत्य् आकाङ्क्षायां&lt;br&gt;&#xA;मन्त्र-मुखेन विवरितुं मन्त्रम् अवतारयति ।&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
