      <description>&lt;p&gt;७. प्राणाधिकरणम् ।&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;अत एव प्राणः (ब्र.सू. १.१.२४)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/10.md&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/1/11.md&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
