    <item>
      <title>09 ज्योतिरधिकरणम्</title>
      <link>https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/tattvam/rAmAnujaH/shrI-bhAShyam/rangarAmAnujaH/viShaya-vAkya-dIpikA/1/1/09_jyotiradhikaraNam/</link>
