      <description>&lt;p&gt;८. ज्योतिरधिकरणम् । ज्योतिश्चरणाभिधानात् (ब्र. सू. १. १. २७)&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/3/12_brahma-gAyatry-upAsanam&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/rAmAnujIyam/vedAH_sAma/tANDyam/ChAndogya-brAhmaNam/ChAndogyopaniShat/rangarAmAnujaH/3/13_jyotir-upAsanAntam13_jyotir-upAsanAntam&#34; newLevelForH1=&#34;5&#34; includeTitle=&#34;false&#34;&gt; &lt;/div&gt;</description>
